Status: Continues into Refactor
Calls SmartAPI on boot to fetch registration data"]
	"ars-test-server" [label="ARS Test Server
ars-test-server" fillcolor="#DDB4F9" fontcolor=black id=ars_test_server penwidth=1.0 tooltip="ARS Test Server (ars-test-server)
