Owner: DINGO
Status: New in Refactor"]
	"name-lookup" [label="Name Lookup (NameRes)
name-lookup" URL="https://github.com/NCATSTranslator/NameResolution" fillcolor="#42A5F5" fontcolor=black id=name_lookup penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="Name Lookup (NameRes) (name-lookup)
Owner: DOGSLED
Status: Continues into Refactor"]
	"node-annotator" [label="Node Annotator
node-annotator" URL="https://github.com/biothings/biothings_annotator" fillcolor="#AB47BC" fontcolor=white id=node_annotator penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="Node Annotator (node-annotator)
Owner: CoCoWG
Status: Continues into Refactor
Registered in SmartAPI without an infores, and its ci/test servers carry no x-maturity and are declared http:// not https://. SmartAPI registers it at biothings.ci.transltr.io/annotator, which does not serve the OpenAPI document; annotator.ci.transltr.io does. Both were live on 2026-08-31, so the ci base URL is recorded here rather than pulled. Prod serves its OpenAPI at openapi.json rather than the webapp/openapi.json that ci and test use, so it carries a per-environment override; ci and test are the intended convention going forward."]
	"nodenorm-es" [label="NodeNorm ES
nodenorm-es" URL="https://github.com/biothings/NodeNormalizationAPI" fillcolor="#AB47BC" fontcolor=white id=nodenorm_es penwidth=2.0 target=_blank tooltip="NodeNorm ES (nodenorm-es)
Owner: CoCoWG
Status: New in Refactor"]
	"pending-api" [label="BioThings Pending API
pending-api" URL="https://github.com/biothings/pending.api" fillcolor="#AD5389" fontcolor=white id=pending_api penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="BioThings Pending API (pending-api)
Owner: DOGSURF
Status: Continues into Refactor
Hosts a number of APIs from the previous phase. Some have moved to CoCo's own ES server (nodenorm, annotator, nameres) and the BTE ones are expected to be removed, but this host is likely to stay live while any of its APIs are still in use, and could host tier 2 knowledge graph APIs later."]
	ploverdb [label="Ploverdb
ploverdb" URL="https://github.com/RTXteam/PloverDB" fillcolor="#3F51B5" fontcolor=white id=ploverdb penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="Ploverdb (ploverdb)
Owner: CATRAX
Status: Continues into Refactor
The SmartAPI record is registered as infores:rtx-kg2 — the knowledge graph — not as PloverDB, the server that hosts it. Its servers are kg2cploverdb.*.transltr.io."]
	retriever [label="Retriever (query API)
retriever" URL="https://github.com/BioPack-team/retriever" fillcolor="#AD5389" fontcolor=white id=retriever penwidth=2.0 target=_blank tooltip="Retriever (query API) (retriever)
Owner: DOGSURF
Status: New in Refactor
API server to route calls to the different tiers"]
	smartapi [label="SmartAPI
smartapi
Hosted at: DogPark AWS" URL="https://github.com/NCATSTranslator/smartAPI" fillcolor="#AD5389" fontcolor=white id=smartapi penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="SmartAPI (smartapi)
Owner: DOGSURF
Status: Continues into Refactor"]
	"test-harness" [label="Test Harness
test-harness
Hosted at: RENCI 🌐" URL="https://github.com/TranslatorSRI/TestHarness" fillcolor="#42A5F5" fontcolor=black id=test_harness penwidth=1.0 target=_blank tooltip="Test Harness (test-harness)
Owner: DOGSLED
Status: Continues into Refactor
The Test Harness uses Smart API to grab the urls for the various components it tests. It isn't really hosted, but is a spawned python script that runs on the RENCI server."]
	"translator-component-toolkit" [label="Translator Component Toolkit
